0..74 Comment "// A structure that refers to itself names its parts by ids into an arena,"
75..146 Comment "// never by address, so it moves and copies as any value and every link"
147..219 Comment "// reads. A heap whose locations are never observed hides its symmetries"
220..298 Comment "// (Sterling, Gratzer and Birkedal, CSL 2024, doi:10.4230/LIPIcs.CSL.2024.19)."
